# Note: frontend/android/app/google-services.json is intentionally NOT
# ignored — Google's own docs say it's safe to commit (it only carries
# project identifiers, no secrets) and the cloud APK build workflow needs
# it present in the repo. The truly sensitive Firebase credential is the
# service-account JSON, which lives only in the Railway env var.
frontend/ios/App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist

